  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Inclusive, Cohesive, and Peaceful Somali Communities (PB) &#x2013; SSWC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Inclusive, Cohesive, and Peaceful Somali Communities is a peacebuilding project to be implemented by Save Somali Women and Children (SSWC) in Dharkeynley, Kahda and Daynile districts in Banadir Region, Somalia. The project will strengthen inclusive community dialogue, mediation and local peace mechanisms to prevent and resolve conflicts, build trust and social cohesion among diverse groups, and promote peaceful co-existence. It will also support collaboration with relevant local authorities and community leaders to address key conflict drivers and reduce tensions in the target districts.</narrative>
  </description>
